<view class="page">
  <view class="top"><view><view class="title">校园地图</view><view class="subtitle">校区平面 · 北向上</view></view><button class="small" bindtap="openSettings">连接设置</button></view>
  <view class="tag">27 个校区地点 · 待办按楼名标点</view>
  <view wx:if="{{placeError}}" class="hint">{{placeError}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{placeLoading}}" class="hint">正在按楼名对照待办…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{placeLoaded && !placeHits.length && !placeError}}" class="panel"><view>待办标题里没有出现楼名或别名，地图上暂时没有地点可标。</view><view class="actions"><button class="small" bindtap="loadPlaces">刷新地点</button><button class="small" bindtap="openChat">去对话记一件</button></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{placeHits.length}}" class="section-title">待办地点 <text class="hint">按楼名或别名匹配，不是定位</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{placeHits.length}}" class="places"><button wx:for="{{placeHits}}" wx:key="id" class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectBuilding" aria-label="选中{{item.name}}，这里有{{item.count}}件待办">{{item.name}} · {{item.count}} 件</button></view>
  <canvas id="campus-map" canvas-id="campus-map" class="map" aria-label="27 个校区地点平面图，北向上，下方按钮可选择地点与楼层"/>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="panel error"><view>{{error}}</view><button class="small" bindtap="renderMap">重新绘制</button></view>
  <view class="hint">橄榄绿描边是选中的地点，右上角圆点是待办件数。方块只表示地点，不是真实占地。</view>
  <view class="hint">校园示意，非精确比例 · 地点坐标取自群务台内置校区表</view>
  <view class="section-title">选地点</view><view class="buildings"><button wx:for="{{buildings}}" wx:key="id" class="{{selected === item.id ? 'primary' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectBuilding" aria-label="{{item.name}}{{selected === item.id ? '，已选中' : ''}}">{{item.name}}</button></view>
  <view class="section-title">{{selectedName}} · {{floor}} 层</view><view class="floors"><button wx:for="{{floors}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{floor === item ? 'primary' : ''}}" data-floor="{{item}}" bindtap="selectFloor" aria-label="{{item}}层{{floor === item ? '，已选中' : ''}}">{{item}} 层</button></view>
</view>
